#: DirSettingsWidgetData.cpp:128 rc.cpp:16
msgid ""
"This is the folder containing XFree86 encoding files. These files (which "
"usually have the suffix .enc or .enc.gz) are used to enable X to have access "
"to more encoding shemes (such as cp1252).\n"
"\n"
"This folder is normally a sub-folder of the system X11 fonts folder - and is "
"usually named 'Encodings' or 'encodings'. As an example, on SuSE Linux 7.1 - "
"the folder is:\n"
"\n"
"    /usr/X11R6/lib/X11/fonts/encodings/"
msgstr ""
"Ovo je direktorij koji sadrži XFree86 encodinf datoteke. Ove datoteke (koje "
"obično imaju sufiks .enc ili .enc.gz) se koriste kako bi X imao pristup "
"raznim šemama kodiranja slova (kao što je cp1252).\n"
"\n"
"Ovaj direktorij je obično poddirektorij sistemskog X11 direktorija sa "
"fontovima - i obično ima ime 'Encodings' ili 'encodings'. Npr., na SuSE "
"Linux 7.1, ovaj direktorij je:\n"
"\n"
"     /usr/X11R6/lib/X11/fonts/encodings/"

#: DirSettingsWidgetData.cpp:137 rc.cpp:17
msgid "Encodings folder:"
msgstr "Encodings direktorij:"

