"\n"
"\n"
"If \"%1\" is listed as the CUPS folder, it is probable that you are not "
"using the CUPS printing system - in which case just ensure that the checkbox "
"is not selected."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Ako je \"%1\" naveden kao CUPS direktorij, moguće je da ne koristite CUPS "
"sistem štampe - u kojem slučaju se samo pobrinite da odgovarajuća opcija "
"nije izabrana."

#: SettingsWizardData.cpp:36 rc.cpp:72
msgid "Settings Wizard"
msgstr "Čarobnjak za podešavanje"

#: SettingsWizardData.cpp:42 rc.cpp:74
msgid ""
"As this is the first time you have used this module, there are some "
"configuration settings that you will need to inform it of."
msgstr ""
"Pošto je ovo prvi put da koristite ovaj modul, postoji nekoliko postavki o "
"kojim ga morate obavijestiti."

#: SettingsWizardData.cpp:50 rc.cpp:75
msgid "Please press \"Next>\" to proceed."
msgstr "Molim pritisnite \"Dalje>\" za nastavak."

#: SettingsWizardData.cpp:57 rc.cpp:76
msgid ""
"<B>NOTE</B>\n"
"<p>As you are not logged in as \"root\":\n"
"<ol>\n"
"<li>The settings set here will refer to your own personal settings - any "
"fonts installed by you will (normally) only be available to you. To install "
"fonts system-wide, login as \"root\".</li>\n"
"<li>Any fonts installed will only be printable by applications that embed "
"the fonts within their output. Basically, for applications such as "
"StarOffice, please login as \"root\" to install your fonts.</li>\n"
"<li>"
"If you are running a font server (xfs), then any fonts installed may not "
"actually be usable - as normally only \"root\" may install fonts in this "
"case.</li>\n"
"</ol>\n"
"To summarize: If you have problems using, or printing, the fonts you have "
"installed - then you should try re-installing them as \"root\" (This can be "
"accomplished via the \"Administrator Mode\" button.)\n"
"</p>"
msgstr ""
"<B>NAPOMENA</B>\n"
"<p>Pošto niste prijavljeni kao \"root\":\n"
"<ol>\n"
"<li>Podaci koje zadate ovdje će se odnositi na vaše lične postavke - "
"fontovi koje instalirate će (najčešće) biti dostupni samo vama. Da "
"instalirate fontove na cijeli sistem, prijavite se kao \"root\".</li>\n"
"<li>Fontovi koje instalirate će se moći štampati samo iz aplikacija koje "
"uključuju fontove u svoj izlaz. U pravilu, za aplikacije kao što je "
"StarOffice, molim da se prijavite kao \"root\" i onda instalirate vaše "
"fontove.</li>\n"
"<li>Ako ste pokrenuli font server (xfs), fontovi koje instalirate možda "
"neće biti upotrebljivi - pošto normalno samo \"root\" može instalirati "
"fontove u ovom slučaju.</li>\n"
"</ol>\n"
"Ukratko: Ako budete imali problema u upotrebi ili štampanju fontova koje "
"ste instalirati, potrebno je da ih ponovo instalirate kao \"root\" (Ovo se "
"može postići koristeći dugme \"Administrativni mod\".)\n"
"</p>"

#: SettingsWizardData.cpp:71 rc.cpp:73
