#: SettingsWizardData.cpp:112 rc.cpp:79
msgid "Anti-Aliasing"
msgstr "Anti-Aliasing"

#: SettingsWizardData.cpp:129 rc.cpp:82
msgid ""
"If you wish to enable configuration of StarOffice, then select the "
"\"Configure\" option, and enter the location of the main StarOffice folder.\n"
"\n"
"NOTE: This is not needed for OpenOffice, and StarOffice version 6 onwards. "
"The only thing that these two require is the existence of AFM files for "
"Type1 fonts. This can be set using the \"System\" part of the \"Settings\" "
"tab when the module has loaded."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite omogućiti podešavanje StarOffice-a, onda izaberite opciju "
"\"Podesi\" i zatim unesite lokaciju glavnog StarOffice direktorija.\n"
"\n"
"NAPOMENA: Ovo nije potrebno za OpenOffice i StarOffice verzije 6 i novije. "
"Jedin što ovi zahtjevaju jeste prisustvo AFM datoteka za Type1 fontove. Ovo "
"se može podesiti koristeći \"Sistem\" dio lista \"Postavke\" kada se "
"otvori modul."

#: SettingsWizardData.cpp:143 rc.cpp:84
msgid ""
"<p>All the required setup information has now been determined.</p>\n"
"<p>This module has two main modes of operation:\n"
"<ol>\n"
"<li><i>Basic:</i> The underlying folder structure is hidden - and you will "
"only be able to install/uninstall TrueType and Type1 fonts.</li>\n"
"<li><i>Advanced:</i> This is for more experienced users, and displays the X "
"fonts folder structure - allowing you to add/delete whole folders to/from "
"the X font path. Using this mode you can also install/uninstall Speedo and "
"Bitmap (pcf, bdf, and snf) fonts.</li>\n"
"</ol>\n"
"To switch between these modes, select the appropriate option from within the "
"\"Appearance\" section of the \"Settings\" tab.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Sve potrebne informacije za podešavanje su sada utvrđene.</p>\n"
"<p>Ovaj modul ima dva osnovna načina rada:\n"
"<ol>\n"
"<li><i>Osnovni:</i> Struktura direktorija je sakrivena, a vi ćete moći "
"instalirati samo TrueType i Type1 fontove.</li>\n"
"<li><i>Napredni:</i> Ovo je namjenjeno za iskusnije korisnike, prikazuje X "
"strukturu direktorija, omogućujući vam da dodate/pobrišete čitave "
"direktorije iz/u X staze fontova. Koristeći ovaj mod također možete "
"instalirati/deinstalirati Speedo i Bitmap (pcf, bdf i snf) fontove.</li>\n"
"</ol>\n"
"Da prebacite između ovih modova, izaberite odgovarajuću opciju na odjeljku "
"\"Izgled\" lista \"Postavke\".</p>"

#: SettingsWizardData.cpp:155 rc.cpp:85
msgid ""
"<b>NOTE</b> As this is the first time this module has been used by you, it "
"has automatically marked the basic folders containing your TrueType and "
"Type1 fonts as needing to be 'configured' - therefore, before closing this "
"module you will be prompted to \"Apply\" these changes. This is necessary "
"even if the folders are empty."
msgstr ""
"<b>NAPOMENA</b> Pošto je ovo prvi put da koristite ovaj modul, on je "
"automatski označio da osnovni direktoriji koji sadrže vaše TrueType i "
"Type1 fontove moraju biti 'podešeni' - stoga, prije zatvaranja ovog modula "
"bićete upitani da \"Primjenite\" ove izmjene. Ovo je potrebno čak i ako su "
"direktoriji prazni."

#: SettingsWizardData.cpp:160 rc.cpp:86
msgid ""
"<p>For further detailed help on how to use this module, please refer to the "
"on-line help documentation.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Za daljnju pomoć u upotrebi ovog modula, molim pogledajte on-line "
"dokumentaciju.</p>"

